  "journal": {
    "anomaly_compass": {
      "title": "A Direction Without North",
      "text": "Three of Orin's compasses, all wrong the same way: every needle turned to the monument. He gave me one he has been altering, and at each survey stake it read differently, until it tipped over and pointed down. The signal is below the monument, and farther. On the pedestal the needle spun, stopped, and a six-pointed shape hung above it for a moment, like the carving. We need to know whether the other kingdoms have seen these symbols. The readings point through Awakening Valley."
    }
  }
